{"id":"u-ec1209f5-c362-4314-972f-b66cba9f8fa0","src":"community","title":"Wanna get buff, kid?","author":"Takahiro  T.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/wanna-get-buff-kid-8","desc":"The following program may positively affect your ability to achieve massive gainz.\n\nFor real, fellas. Hands down.\n\nIf you have at least 4 years of gym experience and you want to elevate your gains to the next level, this program might be the right choice for you.  \n\nDoes it guarantee to work for you? I don't know, man. You have to try it, so you can tell me if it works for you. But I recommend you to be in a caloric surplus. This routine might not work if you are cutting or considering cutting while you are in the middle of the program.\n\nI'm just a meathead and love lifting in the gym. So i came up with this program. \n\nA 5 Days Upper-Lower Push-Pull-Legs Split for the intermediate gym-bro.\n\nPossible schedule:\n• Monday: Upper Body\n• Tuesday: Lower Body\n• Thursday: Push Day\n• Friday: Pull Day\n• Saturday: Leg Day\n\nIf you are brave, you can go ham and work out from Monday to Friday too. It's your choice.\n\nIf you are not able to do the exercise in the program due to limited access or the machines are not available in your gym, then seek an alternative. Like barbells instead of dumbells or smith machine squats instead of barbell squats. Be creative and make use of your time, man.\n\nYou got this.\n\nIt might be a ton of volume for some. It might be too little for the other half. I don't care. Have fun.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":11,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T16:38:04.202Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper Body","Lower Body","Push Day","Pull Day","Leg Day"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}],"note":"or use a barbell, idc. go heavy!"},{"n":"Dumbbell Row","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}],"note":"3-4 sets"}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Go heavy, 3-4 sets"},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":14,"hi":16,"x":4}],"note":"Isolationwork. 4 sets, no negotiations"},{"n":"Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}],"note":"MOG the chump beside you, 3-4 sets"}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Chest Fly (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":14,"hi":16,"x":3}],"note":"big chest, big man. 3-4 sets"},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Finish strong! 3-4 sets"}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Take your time and move some heavy ass weight!"},{"ss":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}],"note":"Hit it from the back."},{"n":"Seated Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":3}],"note":"Don't neglect them."}]},{"n":"Abs Crunch (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":3}],"note":"Or use a machine if your gym has one."},{"ss":[{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}],"note":"Isolationwork, 3-4 sets"},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":14,"x":3}],"note":"Isolationwork, 3-4 sets"}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":8,"x":4}],"note":"Or just bodyweight"},{"ss":[{"n":"Seated Overhead Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":3}],"note":"For the 3D shoulder cannonballs"},{"n":"Reverse Wrist Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":3}],"note":"Don't neglect these."}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":3}],"note":"Moderate weight slow tempo"},{"n":"JM Press","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":14,"x":3}],"note":"Moderate weight use the Smith Machine"}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":14,"x":3}],"note":"Isolationwork"},{"n":"One Arm Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":16,"x":3}],"note":"Isolationwork"}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":8,"x":4}],"note":"Do bodyweight if it's too heavy. Do as many reps as possible per set, if even your bodyweight is too heavy for